@startuml
autonumber
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
title UC-13 - Track Order by Email + Order Code

actor "Guest" as Actor
boundary "My Orders / Admin Purchases UI" as FE
control "PaymentController" as API
control "PaymentService" as Service
database "MongoDB: bills" as DB

Actor -> FE: Start UC-13
FE -> API: POST /payments/guest/orders/lookup
API -> Service: Execute Track Order by Email + Order Code
Service -> DB: Read/write bills
DB --> Service: Domain data
Service --> API: Result
API --> FE: Response
FE --> Actor: Hiển thị trạng thái đơn hàng

alt Alternative / exception flow
  note over FE,Service: Không tìm thấy -> Order not found
end

note over Actor,DB
Pre: Đã đặt hàng (có orderCode và email)
Post: Hiển thị trạng thái đơn hàng
Main flow:
1. User vào trang /order-tracking
2. User nhập email + orderCode
3. System gọi API POST /payments/guest/orders/lookup
4. System trả về: orderCode, items, paymentStatus, fulfillmentStatus,\ncarrier, trackingCode, createdAt
end note
@enduml
